    "detailed_description": "<strong>Welcome to the exciting world of quizzes and intellectual challenges!</strong><br><br>FizzQuiz is a unique game that offers over 100 topics and 10,000 questions designed for true quiz lovers. Play with friends, compete in various rounds, and prove that you're the ultimate trivia master!<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470740/extras/9199695da55c027e722cc933cd41bcff.poster.avif?t=1736500799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470740/extras/9199695da55c027e722cc933cd41bcff.webm?t=1736500799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470740/extras/9199695da55c027e722cc933cd41bcff.mp4?t=1736500799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>Game Features:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Wide Range of Topics:</strong> Choose from more than 100 topics \u2014 from history and science to movies and music. Your game will never get boring!<br></li><li><strong>Diverse Questions:</strong> Experience questions with text, images, videos, and audio. Use your knowledge and intuition to find the correct answers.<br></li><li><strong>Cropped Images:</strong> Face a new level of difficulty with cropped images that will test your attention to detail and associative thinking.<br></li><li><strong>Seven Unique Rounds:</strong> Each round presents a new challenge. Prove yourself and defeat your friends, earn bonuses, and become the quiz champion!<br></li><li><strong>Play with Friends:</strong> FizzQuiz allows up to 10 players to play simultaneously. Gather your team and enjoy the game together!<br></li><li><strong>Earn Points:</strong> Earn points for every correct answer. Collect bonuses for a series of correct answers and outpace your competitors.<br></li><li><strong>Tailored Experience:</strong> Choose topics you like and complete quizzes with different difficulty levels.</li></ul><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470740/extras/dd8ece03f0c5a8c3513a6ccefb3932e0.poster.avif?t=1736500799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470740/extras/dd8ece03f0c5a8c3513a6ccefb3932e0.webm?t=1736500799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470740/extras/dd8ece03f0c5a8c3513a6ccefb3932e0.mp4?t=1736500799\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><strong>How to Play:</strong><br><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>Choose a Topic:</strong> Start the game by selecting one of the many available topics.<br></li><li><strong>Answer the Questions:</strong> Go through seven rounds, answering questions in various formats \u2014 text, images, videos, and audio.<br></li><li><strong>Compete with Friends:</strong> Play together with friends or other players worldwide and find out who the best quizzer is!<br></li><li><strong>Earn Points and Defeat Your Friends:</strong> Answer correctly, earn points, and improve your ranking.</li></ul><br><strong>Join FizzQuiz!</strong><br><br>Test your knowledge and enjoy playing with FizzQuiz. Play anytime, anywhere \u2014 with friends or solo. Show everyone that you are the true trivia master!<br><br><strong>FizzQuiz \u2014 the game that challenges your intellect!</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470740/extras/0e29d5854818e2aba089190771045e4d.poster.avif?t=1736500799\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1470740/extras/0e29d5854818e2aba089190771045e4d.webm?t=1736500799\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https